hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18474","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, Ibn Uyaynah narrated to us, from Mujalid, from al-Shabi who said: Amir ibn Shahr narrated to us, he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Take the saying of Quraysh and leave their deed."
"18475","Aswad ibn Amir narrated to us, Sharik narrated to us, from Ismail, from Ata, from Amir ibn Shahr who said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Take the saying of Quraysh and leave their deed."
